WEBVTT

00:02:26.916 --> 00:02:30.396
So, guys, I'm just going to warn you,
the next 10 minutes will be painful.

00:02:30.796 --> 00:02:32.836
I know the last 25 years
have been painful,

00:02:32.876 --> 00:02:35.196
but don't take this personally.

00:02:37.636 --> 00:02:40.236
This is the stadium of Newcastle United,

00:02:40.276 --> 00:02:41.436
St James' Park.

00:02:41.476 --> 00:02:45.196
Every other week, 50,000
die-hard supporters

00:02:45.236 --> 00:02:47.596
flock to the stadium
to watch their team play.

00:02:48.076 --> 00:02:51.196
And instinctively, Newcastle United
has all the building blocks

00:02:51.236 --> 00:02:53.636
to become a really
successful football club.

00:02:53.996 --> 00:02:56.396
They got a billionaire businessman owner,

00:02:56.436 --> 00:02:59.316
they got a fan base
most other clubs would die for.

00:02:59.796 --> 00:03:01.516
But despite all that,